WEBVTT

00:00:56.465 --> 00:01:00.496
Shifokorlar platsebo atamasini 
1700-yildan buyon, bemordagi simptomni

00:01:00.496 --> 00:01:05.175
yengilatishda sohta dorilarning qudratini 
anglaganlaridan beri ishlatib kelishmoqda.

00:01:05.175 --> 00:01:08.086
Zarur dorilar mavjud bo’lmaganda 
yoki kimdir xayolida o’zini

00:01:08.086 --> 00:01:11.371
nosog'lom his qilsa ulardan foydalanilgan.

00:01:11.371 --> 00:01:15.522
Platsebo so'zining ma’nosi lotincha 
“Iltimos, roziman” degan ma’noni anglatib,

00:01:15.522 --> 00:01:19.127
sarosimadagi bemorni tinchlantirishda 
ishlatilganiga ishora qilmoqda.

00:01:19.127 --> 00:01:23.026
Platsebolar ishonarli bo’lishi uchun
haqiqiy malhamga o'xshashi zarur edi,

00:01:23.026 --> 00:01:25.270
shu tariqa ular tabletka, ampula va

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:26.625
hatto platsebo jarrohligi

00:01:26.625 --> 00:01:29.492
ko’rinishini olgan.

00:01:29.492 --> 00:01:33.871
Ko'p o'tmay shifokorlar odamni bu
tarzda ishontirishning boshqa bir